2.2874 Section 9.3 Conformal Mapping
Contour plots of complex functions
x  -2.0:.05:2.0;
y  -2.0:.05:2.0;
[X,Y]  meshgrid(x,y);
z  X  1i*Y;
z1  sin(z);
u  real(z1);
v  imag(z1);
contour(X,Y,u,'k-')
hold on
contour(X,Y,v,'k:')
hold off
axis equal
legend('Re(sin(z))','Im(sin(z))')
